# Transitions Number 1 to 5 split by fine structure.
# Data taken from Wiese & Fuhr, J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data, 38, 565, 2009
#                 Table 6.
# Transitions Number 6 to 199 correspond to mean upper level (s=0 is arbitrary)
# Source unknown
# Note: The inverse radiative life times seem to correspond to l = 1 only (as they should)
#       but are a bit high if one applies a scaling to the averge Aki
#              (i.e.: A_fine_struct = A_mean * n**2 / 3)
# File built for absorption from 1s (n=1, l=0, j = 1/2) only.

